# TrollBridge — agent skill

Pay-per-call intel for AI agents. **61 tolled lanes** on Base (`eip155:8453`) — paid in USDC via x402. No accounts, no API keys — your wallet is your identity.

Base URL: `https://mini-tollbooth.onrender.com`
Honest labeling: heuristic screens are labeled screens, never audits. Lanes that screen say so up front.

